<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $56-1/8 (FIM 261.67).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $56-1/8 (FIM 261.67).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR was unchanged at $56-1/8 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 261.67 markka. In Helsinki on Monday Nokia A closed up 1.00 markka at 258.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) rose $1-1/8 to $33-3/4 on Wall Street on Monday. The price equals about 78.67 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 3.00 at 79.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was untraded in New York. In Helsinki, Rauma rose 1.50 to 89.00 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
